{"unit_id":"Chhlafiu4312__dsh-mcp-bridge#card-zh","repo":"Chhlafiu4312/dsh-mcp-bridge","commit":"0e04cd340031f3c46c3bd889e5eac90aa2afd013","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-mcp-connect**（DSH 插件，适用于 DSH agent）：把本地或远程 MCP 服务器提供的能力接入 DSH。插件通过 stdio 子进程或经 mcp-remote 转接的 HTTP 服务器完成 MCP 握手，发现工具后将其注册为可调用的 DSH 工具。主要功能包括转发工具调用、按名称筛选工具、读取服务器资源、获取提示模板，并用状态工具查看连接情况；连接中断时会按有限次数重试。适合希望复用 MCP 生态工具的 DSH 用户。需要配置 MCP 服务器列表；没有配置时使用默认的本地 filesystem 服务器。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin.js:203-260","plugin.js:266-299","plugin.js:301-402","plugin.js:418-420","plugin.js:485-562"]}
{"unit_id":"Chhlafiu4312__dsh-mcp-bridge#card-en","repo":"Chhlafiu4312/dsh-mcp-bridge","commit":"0e04cd340031f3c46c3bd889e5eac90aa2afd013","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**dsh-mcp-connect** bridges stdio or remote MCP servers into DSH. It discovers server tools, registers them for agent calls, and can expose resources, prompt templates, tool filters, and connection status. Configure the server list; without one it uses a local filesystem server.","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin.js:203-260","plugin.js:266-299","plugin.js:301-402","plugin.js:418-420","plugin.js:485-562"]}
